### Register a new visitor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/visitors/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "1234567890",
  "purpose": "Meeting",
  "visitingWhom": "Jane Smith",
  "guardName": "Mike Johnson",
  "guardId": "G123"
}

### Checkout a visitor (replace {exitCode} with actual code)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/visitors/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exitCode": "VST1234_1430"
} 